* SFTP request\npipelining
** The problem
*** request and response\nover one channel
*** one round trip per block
*** throughput capped by\nlatency, not bandwidth
** Two constants
*** COPY_BUFLEN 32768 (-B)
*** NUM_REQUESTS 64 (-R)
*** window about 2 MiB
** Negotiated limits
*** limits@openssh.com
*** max read, write,\npacket, handles
*** clamped per direction
*** floored at 64 bytes
*** explicit -B overrides
** Window ramp
*** starts at max_req = 1
*** grows one per reply
*** collapses to 1 past EOF
*** upload bounded by\nid minus ackid
** Imperfect replies
*** short read re-requested
*** buflen shrinks toward\nMIN_READ_SIZE 512
*** empty queue asserted\nat completion
** scp front end
*** MODE_SFTP by default
*** -O selects legacy
*** no shell glob expansion
*** crossload skips local disk
@endmindmap
